    title: "1992 Honda NSX-R: Ayrton Senna's Lightweight Masterpiece",
    excerpt: "Stripped of 120 kg with carbon-Kevlar Recaro bucket seats, blueprinted VTEC V6, and track-honed chassis dynamics.",
