    excerpt: "From a redesigned front end to a new powertrain architecture, Tesla's best-seller gets its most significant update yet. We break down what's new and what it means for buyers.",
    body: "The updated Tesla Model Y (code-named Juniper) has arrived, and it's not just a minor mid-cycle cosmetic update—it's a comprehensive engineering overhaul of the world's best-selling electric crossover.\n\nStarting from €44,990 in European markets, the refreshed Model Y brings acoustic improvements, upgraded suspension dampers, and an aerodynamic drag coefficient dropped to 0.23 Cd.\n\n![2025 Tesla Model Y Long Range AWD Front Three-Quarter | Picture courtesy of Tesla Inc.](/images/vehicles/tesla-model-y-long-range.jpg)\n\n## Interior Refinement and Sound Isolation\n\nInside, Tesla addressed the previous model's biggest criticism: cabin noise and ride harshness. Standard acoustic glass on all windows and frequency-selective dampers turn the Model Y into a genuinely peaceful family highway cruiser.\n\n- **Rear Touchscreen:** An 8-inch rear screen gives second-row passengers independent climate control and streaming entertainment.\n- **Charging:** 250 kW DC fast charging allows 10-80% in 27 minutes on Supercharger V3 and V4 stalls.\n- **WLTP Range:** Up to 600 km on the Long Range AWD variant.\n\n> \"Tesla didn't just update the styling; they engineered the exact refinement and ride quality improvements that customers demanded.\"",
