    body: "Xiaomi stunned the automotive industry when its SU7 Ultra set a blistering lap time around the Nürburgring Nordschleife. Powered by three proprietary HyperEngine motors producing **1,548 HP**, the SU7 Ultra accelerates from 0 to 100 km/h in 1.98 seconds.\n\n![Xiaomi SU7 Ultra Hyper-Sedan with Carbon Fiber Aerodynamics | Picture courtesy of Xiaomi EV](/images/vehicles/xiaomi-su7-ultra.jpg)\n\nEquipped with CATL's Qilin 2.0 battery pack and oversized carbon-ceramic brakes, the SU7 Ultra pairs hypercar performance with seamless HyperOS smartphone ecosystem integration.",
